:"BSD 3-Clause \"New\" or \"Revised\" License","spdx_id":"BSD-3-Clause","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/bsd-3-clause","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTU="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["framework","hacktoberfest","php","php-framework","yii","yii2"],"visibility":"public","forks":6857,"open_issues":521,"watchers":14308,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/pulls/9771","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/pull/9771","diff_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/pull/9771.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/pull/9771.patch","merged_at":"2018-01-24T14:02:03Z"},"body":"This is an enhancement in Html::activeFileInput() for assigning htmlOptions to the hiddenInput field so that client script could interact directly with it.\n\nIn a case where a form uses image upload through ajax like ![BlueImp](https://github.com/blueimp/jQuery-File-Upload), the file input field would be empty since the file was already uploaded before the form was submitted. Therefore, the uploaded file's name could not be retrieved for back end processing after the form is submitted.\n\nAssigning the uploaded file's name to the file input through client script is not possible as it is an insecure operation as shown in this snapshot.\n![screen shot 2015-09-27 at 2 27 41 am](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/6284166/10119141/380c9da8-64c0-11e5-9c45-45e5cb174a9d.png)\n\nOne of the possible solution is to assign the uploaded file's name to the hidden field which has a specific id or class. \n\nOn top of this, if the form attribute was not specified with an enctype specifically to enable file uploads, there will be two inputs having the same input name in the post request. Since the file input is being rendered after the hidden field, the value of the hidden input will be overridden by the file input value.\n\nBy making the htmlOptions of the hidden field configurable, a use case such as described above can be achieved without the need to add an additional hidden field to achieve the requirement. \n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/9771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/9771/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":464806058,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQ2NDgwNjA1OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/464806058","actor":{"login":"HanafiAhmat","id":6284166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6284166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat","html_url":"https://github.com/HanafiAhmat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HanafiAhmat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"ffd48a10d7e67a6cd156f3ea8c5fd4a50f5b351a","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HanafiAhmat/yii2/commits/ffd48a10d7e67a6cd156f3ea8c5fd4a50f5b351a","created_at":"2015-11-15T15:52:19Z","performed_via_github_app":null}]